    content: "Surah Al-Ankabut gives his call to them - worship Allah, the idols you serve own you no provision - and the only answer his people had: kill him or burn him. Allah saved him from the fire. Lut believed him. And Ibrahim said: I will emigrate to my Lord.",
    contentFr: "La sourate Al-Ankabout donne son appel - adorez Allah, les idoles que vous servez ne possèdent pour vous aucune subsistance - et la seule réponse de son peuple : tuez-le ou brûlez-le. Allah le sauva du feu. Lout crut en lui. Et Ibrahim dit : j'émigre vers mon Seigneur.",
